DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45763::$$$message_0439_0000_0000$$$::"...Ugh."::
45764::$$$message_0439_0000_0001$$$::"Ugh..."::
45765::$$$message_0439_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
45766::$$$message_0439_0000_0003$$$::"Ohh... Ohh, ohhh, OOOOHHHH!"::
45767::$$$message_0439_0000_0004$$$::"Here it comes."::
45768::$$$message_0439_0000_0005$$$::"JEANNE! JEANNE, JEANNE, JEANNE, JEANNE,[wvl][hfangry layer=0] JEANNNNNNNNNE!"::
45769::$$$message_0439_0000_0006$$$::"I already told you, I am not Jeanne!"::
45770::$$$message_0439_0000_0007$$$::"It's no use, Saber. There's no curing his Mental Corruption."::
45771::$$$message_0439_0000_0008$$$::(It's at rank A... He can hear what people say, but he can't truly understand them.)::
45772::$$$message_0439_0000_0009$$$::(Still, he probably has enough intelligence to follow orders.)::
45773::$$$message_0439_0000_0010$$$::"My! Don't tell me you have also come here to make a wish to the onsen!? How tragic!"::
45774::$$$message_0439_0000_0011$$$::"You prayed to God, but you never wanted anything for yourself! Have you developed your own desires...? Oh, oh goodness!"::
45775::$$$message_0439_0000_0012$$$::"As I have said many times, my only wish is the salvation of Britain[line len=2]"::
45776::$$$message_0439_0000_0013$$$::"That is wonderful! Now, Jeanne, make your wish to destroy God, and all the humans who betrayed you!"::
45777::$$$message_0439_0000_0014$$$::"I, Gilles de Rais, will make it a reality![wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=キャスター4th face=笑顔3 pos=left time=300 twno=1][hfangry layer=0] Ph'nglui mglw’nafh Cthulhu..."[skip_next_tag]::
45778::$$$message_0439_0000_0015$$$::"Ahh! Stop summoning that awful god-thing here!"::
45779::$$$message_0439_0000_0016$$$::(The intel was correct. Caster worships Saber... I wonder if we can use this to manipulate him...)::
45780::$$$message_0439_0000_0017$$$::(It'll be hard to convince Iri... But Servants are expendable. She won't complain as long as it gets results.)::
45781::$$$message_0439_0000_0018$$$::"Anyway! As the mother of a daughter, I will not allow[line len=2]"::
45783::$$$message_0439_0000_0020$$$::"Huh? Hey, lady, you got a daughter!? How old is she!? Does she look like you!? Introduce us!"::
45784::$$$message_0439_0000_0021$$$::"..."::
45785::$$$message_0439_0000_0022$$$::"Hm. I am certain that if we were to exhibit her daughter in a gallery, it would be very well-regarded."::
45786::$$$message_0439_0000_0023$$$::"..."::
45787::$$$message_0439_0000_0024$$$::"...Maiya. Sorry, but I need you to call up an ex-Soviet soldier. [wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=切嗣 face=怒 pos=center time=300 twno=2][hfburstblood layer=2 ox=-80 oy=40][hfchance layer=2]On a nuclear submarine, we're going to fire an SLBM and obliterate Caster along with all of Fuyuki!"::
45788::$$$message_0439_0000_0025$$$::"Irisviel! I think your husband just muttered something outrageous!"::
45789::$$$message_0439_0000_0026$$$::"Hehehehe. What should I say at a moment like this? A girl with twin pigtails and knee-high socks taught me this expression."::
45790::$$$message_0439_0000_0027$$$::"KILL HIM DEAD!"::
45791::$$$message_0439_0000_0028$$$::"Oh, god! You've really stepped on a landmine, now!"::
45792::$$$message_0439_0000_0029$$$::"Hmm. I'm not sure what's going on, but they've got it out for us."::
45793::$$$message_0439_0000_0030$$$::"That is too bad, Jeanne. Before I grant your wish..."::
45794::$$$message_0439_0000_0031$$$::"We gotta get our wish done, first! It's showtime!"::

